# Copy to .env.local for local development.
#
# Both values are PUBLIC by design — the anon key grants no access on its own,
# because every table is protected by Row Level Security. They live here so the
# app can be pointed at a staging database without editing source code, not
# because they are secret.
#
# Set the same two variables in Netlify:
#   Site configuration -> Environment variables
